  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3_16
    value: <size=13>Awards <color=#FFFF00>72</color> Free Games
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3_17
    value: <size=13>Awards <color=#FFFF00>5-18</color> Free Games
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3_18
    value: <size=13>Awards <color=#FFFF00>10-36</color> Free Games
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3_19
    value: <size=13>Awards <color=#FFFF00>20-72</color> Free Games
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3_20
    value: '<size=16>- Mysterious Symbol "?" is a randomly chosen symbol from             ,             ,              or            .

      - Bet multiplier and lines played are the same as in the Base Game that triggered
      Choose Your Bonus.

      - Bonus Symbol does not appear during Free Games and therefore Free Games can''t
      be re-triggered.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_4
    value: <style=title><size=27>FREE GAMES MEGA STACK FEATURE
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_4_1
    value: <size=20>- Before Free Games begins, a chosen symbol from Choose Your Bonus
      is added to the reel strips.
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_4_2
    value: '<size=20>The chosen symbol can be one of the followings :'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_4_3
    value: "<size=20>- Each Free Game, stacks of the chosen symbol are randomly added
      to the reel strips. \n- A stack is when a symbol occurs consecutively on the
      same reel. "
